{"website_name is not included in untrusted_attributes macro and uses include_website_name method without trailing '?' which deviates from established pattern for gating sensitive fields": 0.24121280014514923, "Href uses user-provided URL without schema validation - user profile rendering binds href to model.website allowing javascript: URLs which could cause XSS when clicked": 0.2753719091415405, "UserSerializer exposes website_name field with full URL path to TL0/anonymous users, potentially leaking internal routing structure and user data": 0.19299404323101044, "Removal of client-side computed property websiteName without ensuring full parity in model/serializer could cause UI inconsistencies if website_name is not consistently available across all serializers or scopes": 0.1723446249961853, "Access-control gating around website_name and untrusted attributes may be inconsistent - if gating logic is misaligned with internal policy, sensitive fields could be exposed or omitted inconsistently": 0.3092059791088104, "URL/domain decision logic relies on Discourse.current_hostname which is a core environmental dependency that could affect website_name values across multisite setups": 0.20131810009479523, "Tests for website_name behavior are tightly coupled to hostname stubs and exact string assertions which can lead to flaky tests in different environments or when URL parsing changes": 0.015454987995326519, "No CHANGELOG entry documenting the new website_name exposure in the user serializer": 0.010370852425694466, "PR description is minimal and does not summarize the change, rationale, or security/privacy implications": 0.008432603441178799, "No documentation explaining the new website_name field or its privacy implications": 0.017440589144825935, "Inline comments indicate property rename from websiteName to profileBackground but may not be in sync with runtime behavior": 0.3873539865016937}